Package: classic-cube
Version: 1.3.8
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Depends: libc6, libsdl2-2.0-0, libgles2, libegl1, libx11-6, libxi6, libopenal1
Maintainer: Juan Pablo Lozano <libredeb@gmail.com>
Description: Minecraft Classic with enhancements
 Classic Cube is a free, open-source client that replicates the 2009
 Minecraft Pi Edition experience while offering optional enhancements
 to improve gameplay.
 .
 Features include multiplayer support, custom texture packs, an
 extended block set, and full gamepad support via SDL2. It targets
 low-end hardware and runs on a wide range of platforms.
